Sophisticated predator took his courage in both paws, and decided to track woman down, anticipating more lavish prey. His intuition served him well, as they soon approached hut on the forest edge. He waited, until Mother entered the hut, Wolf rushed ahead and after he slipped his muzzle through the closing door, broke into the premises.
Peaceful twitting of forest birds was interrupted by two harrowing women cries, but after a few seconds everything was quiet. Only insatiable champing was resounding from behind slightly opened door.  
After swallowing his prey, Wolf noticed pasties, scattered all over the floor.